GNOME Handy is installed system-wide. Enable it for your user account with:

  gnome-extensions enable handy@pkremer.de
  systemctl --user enable --now pkremer-gnomehandy.service

The service can be inspected with:

  systemctl --user status pkremer-gnomehandy.service
  journalctl --user -u pkremer-gnomehandy.service -f

The tel: URI handler is registered as an application. To make it the default
handler for the current user, run:

  xdg-mime default gnomehandy-tel-handler.desktop x-scheme-handler/tel
